cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software or these datasets, please cite the associated manuscript.
type: software
title: Geant4 simulation code and datasets for Ti3C2O2 MXene / PPS gamma-ray shielding composites
abstract: >-
  Two-phase Geant4 Monte Carlo study of oxygen-terminated Ti3C2O2 MXene in a
  polyphenylene sulphide matrix, benchmarked against Pb, W, BaSO4 and Bi2O3
  fillers across six gamma energies, five thicknesses and six filler loadings.
authors:
  - family-names: Suresh
    given-names: Sidharth
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-16
repository-code: https://github.com/sidharth-phy/MXene-PPS-Gamma-Shielding
url: https://github.com/sidharth-phy/MXene-PPS-Gamma-Shielding
license: MIT
keywords:
  - gamma-ray shielding
  - MXene
  - Ti3C2O2
  - polyphenylene sulphide
  - Geant4
  - Monte Carlo
  - linear attenuation coefficient
  - NIST XCOM
